4. WHAT THE WIZARD ACTUALLY DOES
--------------------------------

  - copies the WAD into /home/user/Games/<name>/game.wad
  - appends one line to /home/user/Games/games.list
  - places a real shortcut file (.game) on your Desktop
  - optionally pins the DOOM launcher to the taskbar

Nothing is deleted except by Uninstall, which removes exactly the
files listed above. You can read and edit all of them: on SwirlOS,
everything is a real file.


